OL,3,GNEWSAPatient safety chief concerned
OL,4,Aabout NHS Grampian
OL,5,
OL,6,FScotland's Patient Safety Commissioner
OL,7,Fhas said she is not confident all the
OL,8,Ffacts about concerns raised at NHS
OL,9,FGrampian have yet come to light.
OL,11,FKaren Titchener told BBC Scotland she
OL,12,Fis seeking "independent assurance" that
OL,13,Fchange is being implemented at NHS
OL,14,FGrampian and it is "totally
OL,15,Funacceptable" that the health secretary
OL,16,Fwas not aware of the issues.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
