OL,3,GNEWSAPatient safety chief concerned
OL,4,Aabout NHS Grampian
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes after Dr Mohammed Habib, a
OL,7,Fconsultant at Aberdeen Royal Infirmary
OL,8,F(ARI) leaked an unpublished review from
OL,9,F2022 which found 19 avoidable deaths
OL,10,Famong 45 patients in liver and
OL,11,Fpancreatic surgery.
OL,13,FNHS Grampian said it is aware of the
OL,14,Fissues raised and an investigation has
OL,15,Falready taken place.
